flowchart TD
    Start([Per-tenant relocation<br/>capability question]):::start

    Q1{LDB layout?}:::question
    Start --> Q1

    Q1 -->|Pattern 1<br/>shared LDB| Q2{App changeability?}:::question
    Q1 -->|Pattern 2<br/>one LDB per tenant| TierD["<b>Tier D</b><br/>Pattern 2 plus no app changes<br/>• Full per-tenant relocation<br/>• Filesystem-grained move<br/>• Sub-minute cutover possible"]:::leafD

    Q2 -->|Container immutable| TierA["<b>Tier A</b><br/>Pattern 1 plus no app changes<br/>• Whole-pod migration only<br/>• No per-tenant move<br/>• Noisy-neighbour unmitigated"]:::leafA

    Q2 -->|Small metric<br/>one counter only| TierB["<b>Tier B</b><br/>Pattern 1 plus telemetry<br/>• Identify hot tenant<br/>• Operational alert<br/>• Still no per-tenant move"]:::leafB

    Q2 -->|Extraction code<br/>roughly 1 month work| TierC["<b>Tier C</b><br/>Pattern 1 plus extraction<br/>• Full per-tenant relocation<br/>• Dump-plus-load via app API<br/>• Brief read-only window per move"]:::leafC

    TierA -.->|Stage 3<br/>question| Q3([Evolve to B or C?<br/>Or pod-grained forever?]):::stage3
    TierD -.->|Architectural<br/>sweet spot| Note1[Cleanest relocation story:<br/>no app changes needed]:::note

